  "majority_control": "max(actual held-out majority frequency+1,uniform critical count) rejects every constant classifier. The held-out data histogram must be supplied by authentic data; this review invents none.",
  "probability_reasoning": "Under ALL FIVE individually uniform iid-per-example final-guess nulls independent of fixed labels, each joint event is a subset of its binomial-tail event. E[N]<=5/5000;3*1{N>=3}<=N (all32 patterns checked) implies P(N>=3)<=1/3000. At most30 such all-five-null cohorts have union bound0.01. Dependence across seeds/cohorts is allowed. Served0/floor restrictions only reduce the passing event.",
